%% Command -> decision -> transactional write (event + outbox) -> NATS -> projections & consumers.
%% See ../EVENT_ARCHITECTURE.md and ../STATE_MODEL.md.
flowchart TB
    CMD[Command / Proposal] --> VAL[Validator\nschema + safety + provenance tag]
    VAL -->|reject| REJ[[emit *.rejected]]
    VAL -->|accept| DEC[Owning Kernel component decides]
    DEC --> TX{{PostgreSQL transaction}}
    TX --> ELOG[(events — append-only ledger\npartitioned by class + time)]
    TX --> PSW[(projection write, if this component also owns a read model)]
    TX --> OBX[(outbox row)]
    OBX --> RELAY[Outbox relay] --> JS[(NATS JetStream\nLEDGER / SIGNAL / DERIVED)]
    ELOG -. backfill after NATS outage .-> PROJ
    JS --> PROJ[Projectors\none per read model · idempotent on Event.id · checkpointed]
    PROJ --> PS[(projections.* — current authoritative values)]
    JS --> WMI[World Model ingestion]
    JS --> NOT[Notification Manager]
    JS --> AUDC[Audit Manager]
    JS --> PSUB[Perception / diagnostics subscribers]
    PS --> RAPI[Read APIs\noptional asOfEventPosition wait] --> UI[Experience Plane]
    RDS[(Redis / memory — ephemeral cache)] -. serves .- RAPI
